PLAN TIERS & PERMITTED USE
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

COMMUNITY PLAN (no-cost)
  - Permitted for personal projects, open-source repositories, academic
    research, evaluation, and commercial use by projects generating under
    $2,000 USD in annual revenue.
  - Limited to 2 developers and 1 revenue-generating project.
  - Commercial use beyond these thresholds requires upgrading to a paid plan.
  - Attribution required: retain this license notice in all copies.
  - Includes: field encryption, deterministic/blind-index search,
    auto-encryption, checksum-verified detectors, and all attributes.

ENTERPRISE PLAN (paid, $2,999 / year)
  - Permitted for unlimited commercial use within the purchasing organisation,
    including subsidiaries and affiliated entities.
  - Unlimited developers and unlimited projects.
  - Includes everything in Community, plus: ML PII classifier, Crypto Sentinel
    exfiltration alarm, email/webhook/custom alert channels, compliance
    evidence pack (JSON + PDF), scheduled report delivery, and priority support
    (less than 1 business-day SLA).
  - Redistribution of the Software as a standalone library is prohibited
    without an explicit OEM/redistribution addendum.

5-YEAR LICENSE (paid, $5,999 one-time, 5-year term)
  - Identical in scope to the Enterprise Plan but prepaid for five years.
  - Price is locked and immune to future increases.
  - Unlimited developers and unlimited projects for the full 5-year term.
  - Includes priority support with a 1-hour response SLA.
  - One invoice — no annual renewals.

For plan details, pricing, and to obtain a valid license key, visit:
  https://efcore-encryption.com/#plans

